<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Volkswagen.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Volkswagen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1500 DEM		  PREMIUM	23.1 X</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     23.36 DEM		 GEARING	6.0 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	14.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	25.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT		 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1408 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  MSSXA</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
